Package: com.guacforlife.roothidedebarchiver
Name: RootHideDebArchiver
Version: 1.1.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Watches the RootHide Patcher deb cache, mirrors new packages into iCloud Drive, and publishes the cache as a local Sileo repo on 127.0.0.1:8140.
